{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08988","headline":"听嘉陵江水声寄深上人 · 韦应物","name":"听嘉陵江水声寄深上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凿崖泄奔湍，称古神禹迹。\n夜喧山门店，独宿不安席。\n水性自云静，石中本无声。\n如何两相激，雷转空山惊。\n贻之道门旧，了此物我情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}